{"id":"8c0a6e3c38dda0eb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-canonicalforms.md","title":"Uniqueness of full-length truth-table normal forms","display":"thm-canonicalforms — Uniqueness of full-length truth-table normal forms","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-canonicalforms","aliases":["27-thm-canonicalforms"],"display":"thm-canonicalforms — Uniqueness of full-length truth-table normal forms","depends_on":["[[27-df-canonicalforms]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-clause]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.4 Theorem 1.4, Definition 1.11 and uniqueness discussion","source_printed_pages":"16–17","source_pdf_pages":"40–41","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-canonicalforms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-canonicalforms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-canonicalforms — Uniqueness of full-length truth-table normal forms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"775e79fda1f79171\" href=\"?note=775e79fda1f79171\" title=\"27-df-canonicalforms\">27-df-canonicalforms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.4 Theorem 1.4, Definition 1.11 and uniqueness discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"16–17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"40–41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；规范形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"775e79fda1f79171\" href=\"?note=775e79fda1f79171\" title=\"27-df-canonicalforms\">27-df-canonicalforms</a>，求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLits}\">\\(\\mathrm{CLits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MintermDNF},\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{MintermDNF},\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"775e79fda1f79171\" href=\"?note=775e79fda1f79171\" title=\"27-df-canonicalforms\">27-df-canonicalforms</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f))=f,\\qquad\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f))=f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f))=f,\\qquad\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f))=f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall U\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|=n)\\Rightarrow D=\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)=f\\land\\forall U\\in D\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(U)|=n)\\Rightarrow D=\\mathrm{MintermDNF}(f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)=f\\land\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|=n)\\Rightarrow C=\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalCNF}_n(C)=f\\land\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|=n)\\Rightarrow C=\\mathrm{MaxtermCNF}(f)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>满长一致项/子句分别由一个点唯一决定，按该点的函数值确定是否入选。故完整 truth-table forms 唯一，而一般 DNF/CNF 不唯一；在 n=0 时两条结论仍按空项/空子句约定成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-canonicalforms","status":"resolved","id":"775e79fda1f79171","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-canonicalforms]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-canonicalforms","status":"resolved","id":"775e79fda1f79171","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；规范形式见 [[27-df-canonicalforms]]，求值见 [[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]，$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]，$\\mathrm{CLits}$ 见 [[27-df-clause]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","ancho